## How to attribute

Suggested attribution string:

  See Through China: 臺海衝突下的戰略依賴與國家韌性研究 (Y.C. Wu, 2026),
  CC BY 4.0, https://github.com/yunching0513/See_through_china

Please keep the data cut-off date with any figure or table you reuse, because
the assessments are tied to sources retrieved on that date.

